    "faq1q": "How are folio numbers (SIG) generated?",
    "faq1a": "We have simplified the process. Now all quotations, whether Time and Materials (TS) or Monthly Services (MS), are automatically generated with the unique prefix 'SIG' followed by a consecutive number (e.g. SIG-1024) for easier tracking.",
    "faq2q": "Can I edit a quotation that has already been sent?",
    "faq2a": "If the quotation is in 'Draft' status, you can edit it freely. If it has been marked as 'Accepted' or 'Rejected', the system blocks editing to protect the history. In that case, we recommend creating a new one.",
