    "faq3a": "You can add them directly from the 'New Quotation' screen. In the clients dropdown, select the 'Add new client' option at the end of the list and enter their tax details.",
    "faq4q": "How do I register a Purchase Order (PO)?",
    "faq4a": "Enter the quotation details (eye icon). If you change the status to 'Accepted' (Won), a green panel will appear where you can capture the PO number and update its administrative status."
  },
